                                "sense_id": "391153a9-c3a9-30e6-80d3-df3339a5c394",
                                "text": "But much remains to be done in understanding the complex physical, prechemical and chemical stages of radiation interactions in even the simplest, biologically relevant, condensed materials."
                            },
